// (strict mode). Every comment paragraph in js/**, css/**, test/**, e2e/**
// obeys three rules:
//   1. At most one claim keyword (CHECKS:, PINS:, DOCUMENTS:) per paragraph.
//   2. Guarantee words (guarantees, always, never, ensures, will) may appear
